, an increase of 331 per cent when compared with $28.6 billion for the same period last year.\n\n- Derivatives Market\n\n- The average daily volume of futures and options for the first two months of 2026 was 1,718,637 contracts.\n\n- The average daily volume of equity index options for the first two months of 2026 was 150,570 contracts, an increase of 12 per cent when compared with the 134,064 contracts for the same period last year.\n\n- On 4 February 2026, the volume of Hang Seng TECH Index Futures Options reached a record high of 208,378 contracts.\n\n# Includes fund raised by initial offering by way of subscription, sales and placing\n\nMonth-end figures\n\n Feb 2026\n\n Feb 2025\n\n End 2025\n\n No. of listed companies\n\n 2,700\n\n 2,632\n\n 2,686\n\n Total market capitalisation ($Bil.)\n\n 49,876.1\n\n 39,113.1\n\n 47,392.5\n\n No. of newly listed companies *\n\n 11\n\n 2\n\n 119\n\n No. of listed securities\n\n 17,938\n\n 14,174\n\n 16,969\n\n No. of SPAC shares\n\n -\n\n 4\n\n 0\n\n No. of equity warrants (excluding SPAC warrants)\n\n 5\n\n 2\n\n 5\n\n No. of SPAC warrants\n\n -\n\n 4\n\n 0\n\n No. of derivatives warrants\n\n 7,646\n\n 5,187\n\n 7,012\n\n No. of inline warrants\n\n -\n\n -\n\n -\n\n No. of CBBCs\n\n 5,992\n\n 4,658\n\n 5,673\n\n No. of unit trusts\n\n 247\n\n 209\n\n 240\n\n No. of debt securities\n\n 1,346\n\n 1,478\n\n 1,351\n\n* Includes the number of transfer of listings from GEM to Main Board\n\n Feb 2026\n\n Feb 2025\n\n 2025\n\n Derivatives warrants\n\n 924\n\n 816\n\n 10,266\n\n CBBCs\n\n 2,688\n\n 3,052\n\n 31,444\n\n Unit trusts\n\n 1\n\n 2\n\n 48\n\n Debt securities\n\n 29\n\n 14\n\n 329\n\n Feb 2026\n\n Jan 2026\n\n % Change\n\n Monthly turnover ($Mil.) *\n\n 4,195,067\n\n 5,718,137\n\n -26.6%\n\n Average daily turnover by value ($Mil.) *\n\n 246,769\n\n 272,292\n\n -9.4%\n\n No. of trading days\n\n 17\n\n 21\n\n -\n\n* Turnover value for securities traded in non-Hong Kong dollar currency have been included\n\n Feb 2026\n\n Jan 